This bundle is derived entirely from public reference data and contains no patient data.

- GRCh38 genome assembly (GCA_000001405.15, no-alt analysis set + hs38d1) from NCBI.
  NCBI places no restrictions on the use or distribution of GenBank/RefSeq sequence data.
- Ensembl release 102 gene annotation. Ensembl data are made available without
  restriction on use (https://www.ensembl.org/info/about/legal/disclaimer.html).
- genes.collapsed.gtf was produced with collapse_annotation.py from
  broadinstitute/gtex-pipeline (BSD-3-Clause).
- The STAR index was generated with STAR 2.7.11b (MIT licence).

Provided as-is for research use, without warranty.
